OL,3,GNEWSASinger O'Donnell replaces records
OL,4,Alost in house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor most families, it is the little
OL,7,Fthings that make a house feel like
OL,8,Fhome, like a favourite record or
OL,9,Fsomething kept from childhood.
OL,11,FFor Carol Squires and her family, those
OL,12,Fmementoes were among the things
OL,13,Fdestroyed when fire swept through their
OL,14,Fhome on Gorleston Road in Warstock,
OL,15,FBirmingham.
OL,17,FThey would never have imagined, as they
OL,18,Fcatalogued their losses, that Irish
OL,19,Fsuperstar singer Daniel O'Donnell would
OL,20,Fstep in to help.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
